289
00:12:53.705 --> 00:12:57.138
Apabila saya menunjukkan bahawa,
Kyuhyun berbulu tiba-tiba.

290
00:12:57.205 --> 00:12:58.638
BRISTLING

291
00:12:58.705 --> 00:13:00.871
DAN LAIN LAIN

292
00:13:00.938 --> 00:13:03.271
Saya tidak faham kenapa dia hilang semangat.

293
00:13:03.338 --> 00:13:05.671
